WEBVTT

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:39.370
Jeez! Why did this happen?

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:42.740
"Why?"

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.040
Well...

00:01:44.780 --> 00:01:47.000
You're saying it's my fault?

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:48.480
But it is.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.840
You told them to get the official-

00:01:51.840 --> 00:02:00.480
Yeah! But I didn't think they would run into
town and get rid of all the officials-

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:04.810
So, you need to be more careful when
you're making wishes with that thing.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:08.060
You're really careless with it.

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:10.520
<i>Don't blame everything on me!</i>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:17.490
The whole time, you two were
screaming "Great!" and "Get him!"

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:20.190
Both of you, this isn't the time for fighting.

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.770
Now we're wanted fugitives.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:26.620
If we're caught, we'll be thrown in jail!

00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:29.140
I hope that's all...

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.140
What do you mean?

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.920
In other words...

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.780
What should we do?

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:40.590
<i>I'm too young to die!</i>

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:45.510
The simplest thing for the three of us
to do would be to pack up and run.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:46.770
I like it!

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:47.730
No, it's not!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:53.030
But with just the three of us, we may
be able to hide until things calm down.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.930
No!

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:57.630
Everyone did this because of us.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:02:59.490
We can't abandon them!

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:00.820
But...

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:01.680
Then what should we-

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:04.440
Oh, please don't ask me what to do!

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:09.080
I've never once made a good
decision in my life.

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:11.560
Jeez! Fine!

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.790
We just need to take care of this, right?

00:03:14.730 --> 00:03:15.750
So what do you want to do?

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:18.940
I say we go all the way!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:22.940
We perform every day,
bringing in more and more people!

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.720
Ten thousand, twenty thousand...
No, more.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:28.680
If we have one- or two-hundred thousand,

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:31.690
the army would be too scared to fight us!

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:33.480
Chi-chan, what are you-

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.880
That may not be a bad idea.

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:40.310
In the land of Kanchuu to the west,
there's a religion called the Way of the Five Grains.

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:45.410
I've heard they have members in the tens of thousands,
and the lords of the area can't touch them.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:53.370
If we can get more people and find
some place to stay... Just maybe...

00:03:55.180 --> 00:03:56.140
Let's do it!

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:57.380
Tenhou-neesan!

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.070
OK.

00:04:02.950 --> 00:04:08.480
Those three are finally doing it,
now that they've been cornered.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.520
I guess the <i>Crucial Keys </i>have
finally had their effect.

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:21.280
<b>Episode 11
Bachou Tries
to Hold It In</b>

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.310
Good morning, everyone.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:27.200
I'm Bachou's cousin Batai,
child of Seiryou's Batou.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:32.250
It's once again time for everyone's favorite,
"Watch them wake up!"

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:48.930
Sneak, sneak, sneak, sneak, sneak!

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.630
She's really sleeping.

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:54.100
I can't eat any more.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:55.420
Obvious.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:57.560
So obvious I have nothing to say!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:05:01.800
That aside, her sleeping posture
is as bad as ever!

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.580
She hasn't grown at all since
she was in Seiryou.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:08.070
On the other hand, right here
she seems to be growing rapidly.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:13.040
She isn't as big as Riri-chan's mother,
but she's still pretty bouncy.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:18.000
They say that sleep helps you grow,
but isn't she a little overgrown?

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:27.160
She needs to have her consciousness raised about
the many tragedies her boob inequity causes.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:32.340
Getting back on track now, we have our
daily check to see if she's wet herself.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:34.800
Everyone, hold your breath...

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:36.210
Exciting!

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.220
Sniff, sniff...

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.440
Looks like she didn't wet herself today.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:49.910
I was worried because she ate a lot
of fruit after her bath last night...

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.870
Riri-chan, what are you doing with that?

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:58.740
Oh, my... If you hand that
to me, I'll have to use it,

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:01.340
whether I wanted to or not!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:05.710
What should I write?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.630
Maybe this?

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.190
What does that say?

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.700
I'll tell you later.

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:26.410
Oh! Hello, Sui-chan...

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:34.230
Sui-chan, breakfast is ready, so...

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:37.490
Your face... Go wash it...

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.940
I feel better.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:52.600
"Musclehead"

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.590
Musclehead?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:02.970
Thanks!

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.020
Tanpopo!

00:07:04.910 --> 00:07:08.680
What is "Musclehead" supposed to mean?!

00:07:08.680 --> 00:07:11.570
It means you have muscles
where your brain belongs.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:14.030
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:23.400
Tanpopo, you came from Seiryou to train,
so I'm letting you stay here.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:25.920
But every day, you just screw around...

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.860
<i>Next time you pull a stunt like this,
you're heading straight back to Seiryou, OK?!</i>

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:32.930
Calm down, Sei-chan.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:37.510
Batai-chan plays with my Riri,
and she helps out sometimes.

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:39.480
But even so, stunts like that...

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:52.700
Y-Yeah... That was a bit much,
but she doesn't mean any harm.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:56.370
Yeah, I don't mean any harm,
so you have to let me go.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:57.870
You don't get to say that yourself!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:01.580
OK, then! Let's start our training!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.330
OK!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.120
Start with bunny hops.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.280
Sit ups!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.470
Push ups!

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:16.100
Swings!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:25.460
All right, that's enough for a warm-up.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.910
Let's get started.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:27.890
Fine...

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:35.360
Um, can I ask something?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.410
Where are we?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.620
Listen! By enduring the whirlpool's
fierce waters,

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.790
you'll build up the strength to
face any kind of movement.

00:08:46.390 --> 00:08:49.750
If it gets dangerous, I'll pull
you out. So don't worry!

00:08:50.010 --> 00:08:53.220
No, I was asking where we were-

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.410
Where?

00:09:03.410 --> 00:09:05.520
Where are we?!

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:12.190
Um, can I ask this one more time?

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:15.150
<i>Where are we?</i>

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:19.240
Our next training exercise will be...

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:22.330
doing a handstand and circling
the rim of this volcano ten times.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.630
We came all the way out here for this?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.310
And...

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.310
Come on. Get started!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.090
You're good at walking
on your hands, right?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.760
I don't mind, but if you're dressed like that...

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.720
I can totally see your panties.

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.010
Get started already!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.180
Right!

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.300
Here I go.

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:13.920
Eyes on the arrow, Tanpopo!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:18.880
No matter how fast it is,
you can track it if your eyes are open!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.710
Here I go.

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.620
That's not good enough!

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:41.950
You need to hit it dead center!

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:54.750
Good!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:10:59.780
Can't do any more...

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.180
Make sure you eat, OK?

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.890
Now then, let's take a short
rest and get back to work.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.850
No way. I'm tired...

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:15.760
What? You left Seiryou to train, right?

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.180
You can't give up so easily.

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:21.760
Daily training is an important
part of martial arts.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:26.990
You'll only get good by holding it in and
doing it every day, no matter how much it hurts.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:35.280
I don't know if I want to hear about "holding it in"
from someone who can't even stop wetting her pants.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:37.250
What are you talking about?!

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.230
That was when I was a kid!

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:43.370
Then you can hold it in now?

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:44.470
Of course I can!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.930
Then prove it.

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:49.390
Prove it?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:56.370
If you can drink all this water,
and um, hold it in until dinner,

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:59.030
I'll agree that you don't
wet yourself anymore.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:00.300
All right!

00:12:10.670 --> 00:12:11.900
I drank it.

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.240
That'll do it, right?

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.460
OK, you need to hold it in until dinner.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:19.170
You can't go to the bathroom until then!

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:21.050
Yeah, got it.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:31.200
Jeez... Why did she say that?

00:12:31.200 --> 00:12:34.520
I'm not a kid anymore. Of
course I can hold it in!

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:44.630
This is bad...

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.700
The more I focus on it,
the more I need to go to the bathroom.

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.410
Right! I'll read a book to
take my mind off it.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.370
"Bloom. Bloom. The peach trees blossomed."

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.970
"Advance. Advance. The army advanced."

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:59.480
"The sky is blue. Blue like..."

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.690
I can't take my mind off anything with this!

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:07.340
I know! I'll work up a sweat
and get rid of the water that way!

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.220
If I sweat this much...

00:13:18.250 --> 00:13:20.090
It didn't help...

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:22.780
Actually, it may have made it worse...

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.780
Tanpopo isn't here.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:29.150
I'm right here!

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:37.390
Damn you, Tanpopo!

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:39.250
Guess I'll just go up in the mountains...

00:13:40.890 --> 00:13:43.640
Maybe that isn't a good idea.

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:48.940
But sometimes, when I was traveling,
I had to do it in the bushes...

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:50.410
No, wait.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.600
No, I can't wait anymore!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:58.820
OK, this'll work.

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:01.110
Hey there!

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:06.050
What are you doing here?

00:14:06.050 --> 00:14:07.820
No, well, you see...

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:11.920
Oh, man! Something's flying in the sky that you normally
wouldn't imagine seeing flying in the sky!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.580
Nee-sama!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:19.920
So she knows exactly what I'm doing.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:26.110
When Tanpopo arrived here,
she couldn't keep up with me at all.

00:14:26.110 --> 00:14:28.880
I guess that training's paying off.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:33.810
I don't have time to think about that!

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:42.850
This is bad.

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.190
I'm almost at my limit.

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:48.790
When Tanpopo tripped back there,
I was able to put some distance between us,

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.810
but she'll catch up soon.

00:14:50.810 --> 00:14:52.720
Then...

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.120
Nee-sama wet herself!

00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:02.580
Is this it?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:09.550
Will my name be passed down, through Seiryou's
long generations, as the girl who wet herself?

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.920
No! I'm not done yet!

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.360
There must still be a way!

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:19.390
Don't give up!

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.230
If you give up, it ends right here!

00:15:22.430 --> 00:15:25.190
There must be some way...

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:27.540
I know!

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:32.990
If you want to hide a tree, you hide it in a forest,
so if you want to hide pee, you hide it in water!

00:15:50.160 --> 00:15:55.230
Jeez! Can't believe I slipped back there!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:58.140
I fell into the river, and
now I'm soaking wet.

00:16:01.050 --> 00:16:02.330
That's...

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:04.640
Everyone!

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.660
Sui!

00:16:05.660 --> 00:16:06.690
Rin Rin!

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.710
Sui!

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:08.650
Rin Rin!

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.370
You're back!

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:11.920
I'm back!

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:16.040
What happened? You're soaked.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:19.600
Well, some stuff happened, and
I ended up in the water...

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:20.840
In your clothes?

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:22.680
What?

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:23.790
Who cares?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:29.360
So you came from Seiryou to train with Sui.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:31.880
Yes, I wanted to be like my sister,

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.720
so I'm doing my best every day!

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.320
That's wonderful!

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:39.140
Here you go!

00:16:39.800 --> 00:16:41.560
Skewered grilled river fish?

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:43.130
They smell good!

00:16:43.130 --> 00:16:48.110
I fished them from the river out back just
this evening, so I guarantee they're fresh.

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:52.320
The river out back? The
one by the mountain?

00:16:52.320 --> 00:16:53.780
Yeah, that's right.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.550
I-I see.

00:16:55.550 --> 00:16:57.610
You fished them there...

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.370
Let's eat!

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:02.870
They're good!

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.080
The salting on them is perfect.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.900
I know! You must be using a new salt.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.600
That's why they taste a little different.

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:12.300
No, I didn't change anything.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.920
Yummy fish!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.880
They taste different...?

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.560
What's wrong, Sui?

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.350
You don't want any?

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:22.420
I'm not that hungry right now...

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.340
What?

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:30.230
Sousou-dono wants us to join her?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:35.860
Yes, she received an order from the Emperor
to wipe out the Yellow Turbans,

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.200
and so she wants our peasant
army to join her.

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:40.610
What are the Yellow Turbans?

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:43.160
It must be a group of people like Sui!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.220
Those would be the "Muscleheads."

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:45.830
Hey.

00:17:47.730 --> 00:17:52.950
The Yellow Turbans are fanatical groupies
of the Three Chou Sisters.

00:17:52.950 --> 00:18:01.210
Like the Chou Sisters, they wrap yellow scarves around themselves,
symbolizing their support. So they're called-

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.140
Why?

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.910
Why do we need to wipe them out?

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.930
Did they do something wrong?

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:12.100
Yes. They used to be a group of loud,
but mostly harmless, people.

00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:16.150
But one day, they suddenly turned violent and
got into a fight with government officials.

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:20.000
And ever since then, they've been
attacking government offices,

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:26.060
forcing open their storehouses, and when they've
eaten all their food, attacking another one.

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:27.780
Why are they doing that?

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:34.460
I don't know the details, but the rumor is that
the Three Chou Sisters are urging them on...

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.420
I can't believe that!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:40.890
Their songs were so fun, I can't believe
they'd do something bad like that!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:48.810
I don't want to believe it, either. But the order
to wipe them out means that probably...

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:54.530
Everyone, thinking about
it here won't help.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:58.150
If the Yellow Turbans really
are doing something wrong,

00:18:58.150 --> 00:19:00.800
then we have to stop them.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.410
But if they aren't,

00:19:04.690 --> 00:19:07.370
then we can figure out what to do next!

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:12.070
That's right.

00:19:12.070 --> 00:19:13.830
Ryuubi-dono is right.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:15.640
Sitting here and talking about it won't help.

00:19:15.640 --> 00:19:16.780
Then...

00:19:16.780 --> 00:19:17.630
Yeah.

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:19.630
Let's head out!

00:19:25.980 --> 00:19:28.080
Why do I have to stay here?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:29.310
Of course you're staying here!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.490
You're still in training.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.150
You're staying with us to guard the village.

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:37.610
OK, Sui, Shion, guard the
village while we're gone.

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:40.020
See you, then.

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.570
Be careful.

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:43.160
We depart!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.420
It's kind of you to welcome us personally.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:02.380
Since I asked you to come, of course
I need to be courteous.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:06.000
And you and I are close.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.850
We should be friendly with each other.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:16.650
Anyway, I was surprised to learn that my new retainers,
Gakushin and her friends, knew you.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:21.130
We met them in a village we stopped
at during our travels...

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:24.110
Come to think of it, what happened
to Teiiku-dono and Kakuka-dono?

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:29.730
They're serving me well. Teiiku is a strategist,
and Kakuka is my bodyguard.

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:35.000
By the way, I see that your
army still bears Ryuu's flag.

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:41.300
Well, I think I told you that that man wasn't
the real Ryuubi. The real one was...

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:48.280
Yes, I'm aware. But in effect, you're
leading the army now, right?

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.310
Shouldn't you use your flag?

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:59.840
Well, it's a long story, but I swore a vow of sisterhood
with Ryuubi-dono, and now I'm her younger sister.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:01.770
I see.

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.810
So you're forced into making
your older sister look good.

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:07.500
I don't know if "forced" is the right word...

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:12.200
And we can use the old flag without
having to make new ones!

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:14.670
Hey, don't tell her that!

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:26.390
You're late.

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:28.050
How long are you going to make me wait?

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:30.010
Enjutsu-dono!

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:32.980
Hey, you're that girl from...

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:36.280
A-Are you joining the army, as well?

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.210
Yup!

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:39.990
I'm here because I can't ignore
an imperial order,

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:42.900
but bandit-hunting isn't really my thing.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:45.450
So you guys go get 'em for me, OK?

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:51.730
See why I asked you to come?

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:55.120
Keifa, explain our situation.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:22:00.090
The Yellow Turbans are presently
gathered on this plain.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:06.860
They've deployed in formation around the stage where
their leaders, the three Chou sisters, are thought to reside.

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:08.660
Their numbers are estimated
in the tens of thousands.

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:09.660
Estimated?

00:22:09.660 --> 00:22:11.940
You don't have any hard numbers?

00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.410
I'm sorry.

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:20.630
The Chou sisters have built a complete stage,
and they sometimes perform, to raise morale perhaps.

00:22:20.630 --> 00:22:27.240
Those hearing them join the Yellow Turbans, one after another,
making an accurate count of their numbers impossible.

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:34.700
Even if they're an untrained mob, it will be a
bit difficult, dealing with such a large force.

00:22:34.700 --> 00:22:35.920
Yes.

00:22:36.740 --> 00:22:38.170
Excuse me!

00:22:39.570 --> 00:22:41.130
Kan'u-san!

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:46.050
Sousou-sama!

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:49.120
What?

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:51.330
Kada's here, wanting to see me?

00:24:25.830 --> 00:24:27.540
I'm Hawawa!

00:24:27.540 --> 00:24:29.270
I'm Awawa!

00:24:29.270 --> 00:24:33.050
Together, the two of us are the
Crouching Dragon and the Young Phoenix!

00:24:33.050 --> 00:24:36.120
Next time on <i>Shin Koihime Musou,</i> Episode 12:

00:24:36.120 --> 00:24:40.080
The Generals Attempt to Suppress
the Yellow Turban Rebellion.

00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:45.240
It might not be a bad idea to
try working in pairs like that.

00:24:45.240 --> 00:24:46.500
Let's try it!

00:24:46.500 --> 00:24:47.230
Yeah.

00:24:47.420 --> 00:24:48.380
I'm Sei.

00:24:48.380 --> 00:24:49.460
I'm Sui.

00:24:49.460 --> 00:24:52.180
Together, we're Seisui!

00:24:49.960 --> 00:24:55.010
<b>Episode 12
The Generals
Attempt to Suppress
the Yellow Turban Rebellion</b>

00:24:52.180 --> 00:24:55.010
Why are you looking at me?

00:24:55.010 --> 00:24:59.960
<b>Watch us again, OK?
And rewatch this episode!</b>
